# OpenTelemetry Configuration for CNS Litigation Swarm
@prefix cns: <http://cns.litigation/ontology#> .
@prefix otel: <http://opentelemetry.io/ontology#> .
@prefix yawl: <http://yawlwms.org/ontology#> .

# OpenTelemetry Tracing Configuration
otel:CNSLitigationTracer a otel:Tracer ;
    otel:name "cns-litigation-swarm" ;
    otel:version "1.0.0" ;
    otel:schema_url "https://opentelemetry.io/schemas/1.21.0" .

# Span Configuration for DAG Node Execution
otel:DAGNodeSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "dag.node.execution" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:dag_iri _:dag_iri ;
        otel:node_type _:node_type ;
        otel:jurisdiction _:jurisdiction ;
        otel:filing_type _:filing_type ;
        otel:progress_tick _:progress_tick ;
        otel:agent_source _:agent_id ;
        otel:file_path _:file_path ;
        otel:task_id _:task_id ;
        otel:workflow_pattern _:yawl_pattern ;
        otel:contradiction_detected _:contradiction_flag ;
        otel:evidence_hash _:evidence_hash ;
        otel:iri_reference _:signed_iri
    ] .

# Span Configuration for Contradiction Points
otel:ContradictionSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "contradiction.detection" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:contradiction_type _:type ;
        otel:opposing_counsel _:entity ;
        otel:original_position _:original ;
        otel:contradicting_position _:contradiction ;
        otel:evidence_source _:evidence ;
        otel:timestamp _:detection_time ;
        otel:confidence_score _:confidence ;
        otel:agent_detector _:detecting_agent
    ] .

# Span Configuration for Submission Traces
otel:SubmissionSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "filing.submission" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:submission_method _:method ;
        otel:jurisdiction_target _:jurisdiction ;
        otel:form_type _:form ;
        otel:submission_timestamp _:timestamp ;
        otel:confirmation_number _:confirmation ;
        otel:file_hash _:hash ;
        otel:user_action _:ui_action ;
        otel:copy_button_pressed _:copy_pressed ;
        otel:submit_button_pressed _:submit_pressed
    ] .

# UI Interaction Spans
otel:UIInteractionSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "ui.interaction" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:interaction_type _:type ;  # "copy", "submit", "reminder_dismiss"
        otel:element_id _:element ;
        otel:timestamp _:timestamp ;
        otel:user_agent _:user_agent ;
        otel:screen_coordinates _:coordinates ;
        otel:form_data_hash _:form_hash ;
        otel:session_id _:session
    ] .

# Reminder and Calendar Integration Spans
otel:ReminderSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "reminder.state_change" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:reminder_type _:type ;  # "calendar", "icloud_push", "notification"
        otel:reminder_content _:content ;
        otel:due_date _:due_date ;
        otel:completion_status _:status ;
        otel:delta_detection _:delta ;
        otel:activity_type _:activity ;
        otel:macos_integration _:macos_event ;
        otel:ios_sync _:ios_sync
    ] .

# Evidence Compilation Spans
otel:EvidenceSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "evidence.compilation" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:evidence_type _:type ;  # "email", "contract", "recording", "document"
        otel:evidence_hash _:hash ;
        otel:evidence_source _:source ;
        otel:annotation_added _:annotation ;
        otel:metadata_extracted _:metadata ;
        otel:digest_bundle_id _:bundle_id ;
        otel:iri_signature _:signed_iri ;
        otel:agent_compiler _:compiling_agent
    ] .

# Audit Trail Spans  
otel:AuditSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "audit.trail" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:file_output_type _:output_type ;  # "PDF", "TTL", "YAWL.TTL"
        otel:file_hash _:file_hash ;
        otel:iri_reference _:iri ;
        otel:agent_source _:agent_id ;
        otel:generation_timestamp _:timestamp ;
        otel:file_path _:path ;
        otel:integrity_check _:integrity ;
        otel:digital_signature _:signature
    ] .

# Ultrathink Behavioral Stabilizer Spans
otel:UltrathinkSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "ultrathink.stabilizer" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:cognitive_profile "DISC_99_80_40_40" ;
        otel:directional_focus _:focus_score ;
        otel:distraction_detected _:distraction_flag ;
        otel:off_task_state _:off_task ;
        otel:missed_reminder _:missed_reminder ;
        otel:unpressed_button _:unpressed_button ;
        otel:cognitive_divergence _:divergence_score ;
        otel:entropy_calculation _:entropy ;
        otel:task_scoring _:anti_distraction_score
    ] .

# Agent Performance Monitoring Spans
otel:AgentPerformanceSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "agent.performance" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:agent_id _:agent_id ;
        otel:agent_type _:agent_type ;
        otel:task_completion_time _:completion_time ;
        otel:loop_stall_detected _:stall_flag ;
        otel:tick_usage _:tick_count ;
        otel:memory_coordination _:memory_ops ;
        otel:decision_quality _:decision_score ;
        otel:workflow_pattern_compliance _:pattern_compliance
    ] .

# Cross-Agent Coordination Spans
otel:CoordinationSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "agent.coordination" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:coordination_type _:type ;  # "memory_share", "task_handoff", "decision_sync"
        otel:source_agent _:source ;
        otel:target_agent _:target ;
        otel:coordination_data _:data_hash ;
        otel:ttl_graph_update _:graph_update ;
        otel:declarative_logic _:logic_applied ;
        otel:state_transformation _:state_change
    ] .

# YAWL Workflow Pattern Execution Spans
otel:WorkflowPatternSpan a otel:SpanKind ;
    otel:name "yawl.pattern.execution" ;
    otel:attributes [
        otel:pattern_number _:pattern_num ;  # 1-43 (Van der Aalst)
        otel:pattern_name _:pattern_name ;
        otel:execution_context _:context ;
        otel:branching_condition _:condition ;
        otel:synchronization_point _:sync_point ;
        otel:cycle_iteration _:iteration ;
        otel:instance_count _:instances ;
        otel:pattern_completion _:completion_status
    ] .

# ttl2gspy Integration Configuration
cns:TTL2GSPYIntegration a cns:GraphVisualization ;
    cns:exploration_tool "ttl2gspy" ;
    cns:graph_labels [
        cns:jurisdiction _:jurisdiction ;
        cns:filing_type _:filing_type ;
        cns:targeted_entity _:entity ;
        cns:progress_tick _:tick ;
        cns:dag_iri _:dag_iri ;
        cns:file_path _:file_path
    ] ;
    cns:span_correlation otel:span_id ;
    cns:ttl_export_format "turtle" ;
    cns:graph_query_endpoint "http://localhost:8080/sparql" .

# Metric Configuration
otel:CNSMetrics a otel:MeterProvider ;
    otel:meters [
        otel:litigation_success_rate "Counter of successful filings" ;
        otel:jurisdiction_response_time "Histogram of response times" ;
        otel:contradiction_detection_rate "Rate of contradiction detection" ;
        otel:evidence_compilation_time "Time to compile evidence bundles" ;
        otel:ultrathink_stabilization_events "Count of cognitive stabilization events" ;
        otel:agent_coordination_efficiency "Efficiency of cross-agent coordination" ;
        otel:workflow_pattern_usage "Usage frequency of YAWL patterns" ;
        otel:ui_interaction_completion_rate "Rate of completed UI interactions"
    ] .